        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamashumi amathathu nanye ka-Asa, inkosi yakwaJuda, u-Omri waba yinkosi phezu kuka-Israyeli, iminyaka eyishumi nambili; iminyaka eyisithupha wabusa eTirisa.",
