              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye izindaba zika-Omri azenzayo, namandla akhe awazenzayo, angithi zilotshiwe encwadini yezindaba zemihla ngemihla yamakhosi akwa-Israyeli na?",
