              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamashumi amathathu nesishiyagalombili ka-Asa inkosi yakwaJuda, u-Ahabi, indodana ka-Omri, waba ngukumkani kwa-Israyeli; u-Ahabi, indodana ka-Omri, wabusa phezu kuka-Israyeli iminyaka engamashumi amabili nambili eSamariya.",
