              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi, njengokungathi kuyinto elula kuye ukuhamba ezonweni zikaJerobowamu, indodana kaNebati, wathatha u-Izebeli indodakazi ka-Etibhali inkosi yamaSidoni ukuba abe ngumkakhe, wahamba wambulala. Wakhonza uBali, wakhuleka kuye.",
          "type": "text",
